WEBVTT

00:19:28.477 --> 00:19:31.109
on five continents,

00:19:31.109 --> 00:19:32.736
and people who understand

00:19:32.736 --> 00:19:35.026
far more about carbon than I do

00:19:35.026 --> 00:19:38.084
calculate that, for illustrative purposes,

00:19:38.084 --> 00:19:40.878
if we do what I am showing you here,

00:19:40.878 --> 00:19:44.903
we can take enough carbon out of the atmosphere

00:19:44.903 --> 00:19:48.237
and safely store it in the grassland soils

00:19:48.237 --> 00:19:49.863
for thousands of years,

00:19:49.863 --> 00:19:54.859
and if we just do that on about half the world's grasslands

00:19:54.859 --> 00:19:56.213
that I've shown you,

00:19:56.213 --> 00:19:59.913
we can take us back to pre-industrial levels,

00:19:59.913 --> 00:20:01.554
while feeding people.